(text "NMEA 2000. No 120 ohm resistor is placed across CANH and CANL. Fabrication package prepared; not ordered..\\nGND_CAN is not GND and not REED_RET. NET-S is a connector pin with no copper.\\nThe publish jumper is open by default. Open, the isolated 5 V module is off and this board does not drive the bus." (at 20 250 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "0eb4853e-8a91-43b4-8bfa-115e86fef145"))
